# ---- Measurement data: local only, not tracked ----
# Raw acquisition output under data/ is ~5 GB and individual stream CSVs
# exceed GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit. The data lives on disk / OneDrive.
# Only the write-ups that explain each run are tracked.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/*.md
!data/**/*.txt

# Compiled docs / build artifacts
docs/_build/
*.bit

# LaTeX intermediates (keep .tex source + .pdf output, drop the rest)
*.aux
*.nav
*.out
*.snm
*.toc
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz

# Temporary
tmp/
*.tmp
*.log
